        <type>bool</type>
        <definition>bool vy_write_src::is_end_of_key</definition>
        <argsstring></argsstring>
        <name>is_end_of_key</name>
        <briefdescription>
<para>If this flag is set, this is a so called &quot;virtual&quot; source. </para>        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>A virtual source does not stand for any mem or run, but represents a delimiter between the current key and the next one. There is a special rule used by the write iterator heap when comparing with a virtual source. Such source is greater than any source with the same key and less than any source with a greater key, regardless of LSN. </para>        </detaileddescription>
